        "id": 10429,
        "name": "Grails",
        "username": "Grails",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/edb3f5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-02T05:16:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you draw nightmists entire deck, which is entirely possible as much as she draws, and then only play heedless lash, with a master of magic in play, would she be able to play heedless lash over and over, dealing infinite damage? &nbsp;It works as far as I can figure, any objections?</p>",
