        "raw": "<p>If you draw nightmists entire deck, which is entirely possible as much as she draws, and then only play heedless lash, with a master of magic in play, would she be able to play heedless lash over and over, dealing infinite damage? &nbsp;It works as far as I can figure, any objections?</p>",
